IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `types`

§ `Chapter 1 -- Preliminary`

-- Penal Code 1871 ss 2, 3, 4, 4A, 4B.
-- Source: registers/source-bundle/PC1871.txt.

§§ `Section 2 -- Offences committed within Singapore`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 2"
@export Decide whether section 2 would treat the act as committed within Singapore
GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act` @desc The proposed act. Set place of the act to wholly in Singapore, wholly outside Singapore, or partly in Singapore.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the act is committed within Singapore` IF
    a's `place of the act` EQUALS `wholly in Singapore`

§§ `Section 4 -- Public servants acting outside Singapore`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 4"
GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the act is deemed committed in Singapore by a public servant` IF
        (a's `actor`)'s `is a public servant`
    AND (a's `actor`)'s `is a citizen or permanent resident of Singapore`
    AND (a's `actor`)'s `is acting or purporting to act in the course of employment`
    AND a's `place of the act` EQUALS `wholly outside Singapore`

§§ `Section 4B -- Specified offences with mixed-territory elements`

-- A specified offence is deemed committed in Singapore where:
-- (a) a relevant act occurs in Singapore and any other relevant act occurs outside;
-- (b) a relevant act occurs partly in Singapore and partly outside; or
-- (c) the offence involved an intention to make a gain, or to cause a loss or
--     exposure to a risk of loss, or to cause harm to any person in body, mind,
--     reputation or property, and that gain, loss or harm occurs in Singapore.

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 4B(1)"
GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a relevant-act limb of section 4B is met` IF
        (    a's `place of the act` EQUALS `wholly in Singapore`
         AND a's `place of any other relevant act` EQUALS `wholly outside Singapore`)
    OR  (    a's `place of the act` EQUALS `wholly outside Singapore`
         AND a's `place of any other relevant act` EQUALS `wholly in Singapore`)
    OR  a's `place of the act` EQUALS `partly in Singapore`
    OR  a's `place of any other relevant act` EQUALS `partly in Singapore`
    OR  (    (   a's `intends to make a gain or cause a loss or harm`
              OR a's `intends to cause exposure to a risk of loss`)
         AND a's `that gain loss or harm occurs in Singapore`)

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 4B(1)"
@export Decide whether section 4B would deem a specified offence committed in Singapore on the location and gain-or-harm facts (the caller must also establish that the offence is in the Schedule)
GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act` @desc The proposed act. Set place of the act, place of any other relevant act, intends to make a gain or cause a loss or harm, and that gain loss or harm occurs in Singapore. Combine with the Schedule test in the agent-compliance module.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 4B location facts are met` IF
    `a relevant-act limb of section 4B is met` a

